From 41bab3f106d071ce73697cee459712ee7337d80e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:07:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: preserve unthrottled progress and deferred integer
 hex diagnostics

Provide an explicit typed Info bypass for existing unthrottled progress sites; ring-full policy stays unchanged. Render bounded zero-padded integer hex on the logger thread while retaining numeric JSON values. Extend AST rules and lint to reject rate-limit, type or formatting drift.

Validation: conversion fixtures 15/15, structured lint contracts 12/12, focused source lint passes. Native hex/bypass tests added; compilation and execution are pending the shared resource grant, so not yet claimed passing.
---
